31,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Good morning. I have some information to share. I am the Seer, and my divination from last night reveals that May is the Werewolf.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,May,,"What?! Asuka, that's a bold lie! I'm just a villager! You're probably the werewolf trying to frame me right from the start to get a quick win!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Wow, this is a huge twist! Asuka, are you really the Seer? If May is the werewolf, then we can win right now! This is so exciting!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minako,,"This is a very direct start. Asuka, if you are indeed the Seer, this simplifies things, but we must consider if this is a bluff by the werewolf to eliminate a non-threat.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"It's a high-risk, high-reward play. If Asuka is lying, she's essentially outing herself as the werewolf or the Possessed. However, if she's telling the truth, the game ends today. May, your reaction was quite immediate.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I am telling the truth. I have no reason to lie about my role this early unless I wanted to be executed immediately, which would be illogical. May, your immediate denial is expected, but the facts remain.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,May,,"You're just trying to sound logical to trick us! @Minako, @Shion, think about it! If the werewolf were the Seer, they'd do exactly this to get me out of the way. I'm a villager, I swear!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I believe Asuka! She's been so calm and smart since yesterday. May, you're acting way too panicked now! It's like you're scared because you got caught!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Rin, let's stay calm. May, your panic is noted, but Asuka's claim is very specific. If we execute May and she's a villager, we lose a valuable member. However, if we keep her and she's the wolf, we risk another death tonight.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"The risk of keeping a werewolf is far greater than the risk of executing a villager in this scenario. May, your defense is purely emotional, whereas Asuka's claim is a direct strike. I'm leaning toward Asuka.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I appreciate the support from Shion and Rin. Minako, while I understand your caution, the risk of leaving a confirmed werewolf alive is an unacceptable gamble for the village. May, do you have any evidence to counter my claim?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin"",""Minako"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,May,,"Evidence? I'm a villager! The only ""evidence"" is a claim from someone who could be the wolf herself! Why should we trust Asuka just because she sounds ""logical""? She's just manipulating you all!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,But you're the one who's manipulating us! You're just saying Asuka is lying because you don't have anything else to say! I'm totally voting for May!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I've listened to both sides. May, your defense is based entirely on attacking Asuka's character rather than providing a logical counter-argument. While I dislike rushing, the probability favors Asuka's claim.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I've reached a conclusion. May's desperation is palpable, and she has failed to provide any logical reason to doubt Asuka's claim. The most rational move is to trust the Seer and eliminate the threat now.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I believe the evidence is clear. I have provided the truth, and May has provided only desperation. I urge you all to vote for May so we can secure the village's safety today.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,May,,"This is a nightmare! You're all just going to listen to her? Please, don't do this! If you kill me, you're just helping the real werewolf win! I'm innocent!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm sorry, May, but you're just too suspicious! Asuka is the Seer, and she said you're the wolf, so that's it! Bye-bye, werewolf!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Minako,,"I have decided to trust Asuka's divination. The risk of leaving a werewolf among us is too high, and May's defense has not been convincing. I will vote for May.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I'll follow the logic. Asuka's claim is direct, and May's response has been nothing but emotional noise. There is no reason to doubt the Seer at this point. I vote for May.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
